{"name":"Hollow Knight","hex":"#330055","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"hollow","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small valley between mountains.","A sunken area on a surface."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["to make a hole in something; to excavate"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/hollow"},{"term":"knight","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A young servant or follower; a trained military attendant in service of a lord.","A minor nobleman with an honourable military rank who had served as a page and squire."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To confer knighthood upon.","To promote (a pawn) to a knight."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/knight"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hollow Knight","blocks":[{"text":"Hollow Knight is a 2017 Metroidvania video game developed and published by Australian independent development studio Team Cherry. The player controls a nameless insectoid warrior in exploring Hallownest, a fallen kingdom plagued by a supernatural disease. The game is set in diverse subterranean locations, featuring friendly and hostile insectoid characters and numerous bosses. Players have the opportunity to unlock abilities as they explore, along with pieces of lore and flavour text that are spread throughout the kingdom."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/de/Hollow_Knight_2026_cover_art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hollow_Knight","wikidata":"Q29300592"},{"title":"Knight","blocks":[{"text":"A knight is a person granted an honorary title of a knighthood by a head of state or representative for service to the monarch, the church, or the country, especially in a military capacity."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Codex_Manesse_Hartmann_von_Aue.jpg/330px-Codex_Manesse_Hartmann_von_Aue.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=t